微服务之间的通信是分布式系统的核心挑战，需要考虑服务发现、负载均衡、弹性策略等。


## 服务发现

**Consul**：
```csharp
// 安装 NuGet 包
// Consul

builder.Services.AddSingleton<IConsulClient>(sp =>
    new ConsulClient(c => c.Address = new Uri("http://localhost:8500")));

// 注册服务
app.Lifetime.ApplicationStarted.Register(async () =>
{
    var client = app.Services.GetRequiredService<IConsulClient>();
    await client.Agent.ServiceRegister(new AgentServiceRegistration
    {
        ID = "user-service-1",
        Name = "user-service",
        Address = "localhost",
        Port = 5001,
        Check = new AgentServiceCheck
        {
            HTTP = "http://localhost:5001/health",
            Interval = TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10)
        }
    });
});

// 发现服务
var services = await client.Health.Service("user-service", null, true);
var service = services.Response.First();
var baseUrl = $"http://{service.Service.Address}:{service.Service.Port}";
```

**HttpClient 服务发现**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddHttpClient("user-service", (sp, client) =>
{
    var consul = sp.GetRequiredService<IConsulClient>();
    var services = consul.Health.Service("user-service").Result.Response;
    var service = services.First();
    client.BaseAddress = new Uri($"http://{service.Service.Address}:{service.Service.Port}");
});
```

## Polly 弹性策略

Polly 是 .NET 的弹性和瞬态故障处理库：

**重试策略**：
```csharp
var retryPolicy = Policy
    .Handle<HttpRequestException>()
    .WaitAndRetryAsync(3, retryAttempt =>
        TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Pow(2, retryAttempt)));

await retryPolicy.ExecuteAsync(async () =>
{
    await httpClient.GetAsync("/api/users");
});
```

**熔断器**：
```csharp
var circuitBreakerPolicy = Policy
    .Handle<HttpRequestException>()
    .CircuitBreakerAsync(
        exceptionsAllowedBeforeBreaking: 5,
        durationOfBreak: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30));

await circuitBreakerPolicy.ExecuteAsync(async () =>
{
    await httpClient.GetAsync("/api/users");
});
```

**超时策略**：
```csharp
var timeoutPolicy = Policy
    .TimeoutAsync(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));

await timeoutPolicy.ExecuteAsync(async () =>
{
    await httpClient.GetAsync("/api/users");
});
```

**组合策略**：
```csharp
var policy = Policy.WrapAsync(retryPolicy, circuitBreakerPolicy, timeoutPolicy);
```

**与 HttpClient 集成**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddHttpClient("user-service")
    .AddPolicyHandler(GetRetryPolicy())
    .AddPolicyHandler(GetCircuitBreakerPolicy());

static IAsyncPolicy<HttpResponseMessage> GetRetryPolicy()
{
    return HttpPolicyExtensions
        .HandleTransientHttpError()
        .WaitAndRetryAsync(3, retryAttempt =>
            TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Pow(2, retryAttempt)));
}

static IAsyncPolicy<HttpResponseMessage> GetCircuitBreakerPolicy()
{
    return HttpPolicyExtensions
        .HandleTransientHttpError()
        .CircuitBreakerAsync(5, TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30));
}
```


## Ocelot API 网关

Ocelot 是 .NET 的 API 网关：
```json
// ocelot.json
{
  "Routes": [
    {
      "UpstreamPathTemplate": "/api/users/{everything}",
      "UpstreamHttpMethod": [ "GET", "POST", "PUT", "DELETE" ],
      "DownstreamPathTemplate": "/api/users/{everything}",
      "DownstreamScheme": "http",
      "DownstreamHostAndPorts": [
        {
          "Host": "user-service",
          "Port": 5001
        }
      ],
      "LoadBalancerOptions": {
        "Type": "LeastConnection"
      }
    }
  ],
  "GlobalConfiguration": {
    "BaseUrl": "http://localhost:5000"
  }
}
```

```csharp
// 配置 Ocelot
builder.Configuration.AddJsonFile("ocelot.json", optional: false, reloadOnChange: true);
builder.Services.AddOcelot();

app.UseOcelot().Wait();
```

## 负载均衡

Ocelot 支持多种负载均衡策略：
- **LeastConnection**：最少连接
- **RoundRobin**：轮询
- **NoLoadBalancer**：不负载均衡


